      "cooked": "<p>This just happened on my first run through with Chokepoint.&nbsp; Shinobi Assassin came up in the environment then Stripped Resources promptly destroyed it.&nbsp; I have one text saying, \"Destroy all environment cards.&nbsp; Put any targets destroyed this way face-down in the villain play area.\"</p><p>But another text states, \"When this card would be destroyed, move it to the top of&nbsp;a hero deck instead.\"</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I would tend to think that the Shinobi Assassin would go to the top of a hero deck.</p>",
